62	 * surface every publish flow traverses. It is deliberately dumb bookkeeping:
63	 * per-account rows, idempotent upserts, union liveness, and a per-account
64	 * quota sum. It authorizes nothing across accounts and holds no state a
65	 * client cannot rebuild from the network.
66	 *
67	 * Determinism/side-effects are injected: the physical unpin rides the
68	 * [`PinStore`] seam, never a direct Kubo call in this logic.
