243	    // own provider and bypass the API (blueprint/api.md, Content plane). Pinning
244	    // them to hosted Kubo off an advisory, uncounted row would be free hosted
245	    // storage, so refuse rather than pin. The row lock above makes this read and
246	    // the quota gate below atomic w.r.t. setByo, so a hosted upload past this
247	    // point always registers an AUTHORITATIVE (advisory=false) row.
248	    if (user.byo) {
